{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Descend into the forgotten depths of Banban\u2019s Kindergarten. Survive sinister horrors and unravel dark secrets hidden in every corner. Uncover the truth behind the facility and find the whereabouts of your missing child\u2026</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895950/extras/d3116958142692ec9a3d10a9bcd534dc.poster.avif?t=1767738963\" width=560 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895950/extras/d3116958142692ec9a3d10a9bcd534dc.webm?t=1767738963\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895950/extras/d3116958142692ec9a3d10a9bcd534dc.mp4?t=1767738963\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Abyss:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beneath the surface lies a forgotten place full of abandoned sectors, failed systems, and creatures that were never meant to exist. These walls are colder, more volatile, and far less forgiving. Every step forward demands caution, because everything down here is watching.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Truth:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nothing is safe. Nothing is promised. The truth behind Banban\u2019s Kindergarten is closer than ever, but reaching it means surviving a place that no longer follows logic. Keep moving, stay alert, and understand this: the deeper you go, the less of yourself comes back.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3895950?t=1767738963","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3895950?t=1767738963","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895950/6b8a19ecdfbfecc8b4